1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,960
Hybrid-ready daw ang inverter
mo. May backup ka na ba?

2
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:07,080
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:11,700
Hindi pa. Ibig sabihin lang,
puwede itong lagyan ng battery.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,710
Para gumana ang backup, kailangan
ng compatible na battery,

5
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,970
tamang backup wiring o
critical loads panel,

6
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,970
at inverter na naka-set
up talaga para sa backup.

7
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:27,060
Kung kulang ang mga 'yan,
puwedeng brownout ka pa rin.

8
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:31,030
Kaya bago bumili, ipa-verify
ang buong backup setup.

9
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:36,940
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

10
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:39,750
Life is SoLight with Solar.
